    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Repository Detail",
      "description": "Every percentage sits beside the sample size behind it. Sorted by attributed lines, not by AI share: a repo with three attributed lines can otherwise look authoritative. 'Failed' means git-ai could not produce stats at all; 'Stale' means the numbers are a replayed last-known-good.",
